      "timestamp_minutes": 35.0,
      "type": "reassess",
      "args": {},
      "justification": "AHA ACLS guidelines mandate evaluation of reversible causes (Hs and Ts: hypoxia, hypovolemia, hydrogen ion, hypo/hyperkalemia, hypothermia, tension pneumothorax, tamponade, toxins, thrombosis) to identify and treat underlying etiology of cardiac arrest."
    },
    {
